IsShown [SimTalk] - SankeyDiagram
Activates (true) or deactivates (false) the display of the SankeyDiagram designated by <Path>.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.IsShown:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
MySankeyDiagram.IsShown := false
See also
Show Diagram
IsShown [SimTalk] - SankeyDiagram
Plant Simulation Help 11-4881
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

MaximumWidth [SimTalk]
Sets the maximum width with which Plant Simulation visualizes the Sankey flows of the parts and Workers
of the SankeyDiagram designated by <Path> in the Frame.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.MaximumWidth:length
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type length.
Example
MySankeyDiagram.MaximumWidth := 1.0 –- meters
See also
Maximum Width [SankeyDiagram]
MaximumWidth [SimTalk]
